    <h2>What this page could not verify<span class="accent">.</span>.</h2>
    <div class="warn">
      Three things, stated plainly so you know which parts of this page are reads and which are reconstruction.
      <br><br>
      <b>1. The sixth car value.</b> Five of the six boxes were stable across every frame we sampled: 05, 66, 50, 06, 08. The sixth box read differently in different frames — the OCR pass returned 00 while it was still being typed, then 02, then 05 — and our zoomed reads did not agree either. We do not print a number for it. The letters behind the first five are certain because each follows from an equation we read twice; H has no such check.
      <br><br>
      <b>2. What the Shovel and the Baseball bat actually do.</b> Both enter the inventory and the footage never shows the action that consumes them. They are listed as collected items, not as steps with a fixed target.
      <br><br>
      <b>3. The reward and the exit.</b> The recording ends at 4:56 on a THANKS FOR WATCHING card, after the Key is revealed but before any results panel. No coin figure is printed here because we have not seen one.
    </div>
